<title>SPAIN: Chairman Telefonica international resigns.</title>
<headline>Chairman Telefonica international resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telefonica de Espana's managing director and chairman of its international unit TISA SA, German Ancochea, has decided to resign from the Spanish telephone operator, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Telefonica credits Ancochea with positioning the company internationally in telecommunications and preparing it to successfully confront sector innovation and liberalisation.</p>
<p>Telefonica shares closed 30 pesetas higher at 2,415.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2151</p>
